(text "BASELINE SIX-JOINT DIFFERENTIAL TRANSMITTER - SCHEMATIC BLOCK r0.2" (at 17.78 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e254d2e5-e613-578b-8fc4-3c345282a103"))
(text "12 STEP/DIR signals / 3 AM26C31IPWR banks. No PCB, line protection, external permission latch or machine qualification." (at 17.78 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0a046fd4-fb2e-5927-96b9-d280bfdcde20"))
(text "TX_PERMIT must be a hardware-qualified 3.3V permission signal. /G is tied high; G has three 10k pulldowns.\nAbsent permission means HIGH-Z, not a guaranteed low at the remote receiver. Independent drive inhibit and receiver bias are required." (at 17.78 271.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7489cc70-109b-5847-875b-084d87e7bd55"))
(text "JLOGIC1 is an internal circuit boundary,\nnot an assigned FPGA package or connector.\n3.3V logic; no 5V pull-ups on FPGA nets.\nDo not drive inputs while drivers are unpowered.\nSIGNAL_5V is externally supplied at 4.5–5.5V.\nNo current, thermal or partial-power proof." (at 81.28 299.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ebefa23e-57e5-5e30-a45e-84a737c88d36"))
(text "JREF1.1/2/3 map to ledger JPOWER.5/6/7:\nTX0/1/2_REFERENCE, each bonded to LOGIC_GND.\nJREF1 is only a review boundary, not a new final connector.\nLine pairs are not galvanically isolated; qualify common mode." (at 198.12 322.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d785ca93-343f-51ed-85a0-ce0008c787d2"))
(text "TI SLLS103P: Fig 4-1, Table 7-1, Sections 5.3/8.3.\n33R damping and 10k defaults remain provisional.\nThree permission pulldowns load the source in parallel.\nAll capacitor/resistor MPNs and connector footprints TBD.\nNo fabrication files or manufacturing release.\nOriginal two-joint tx_bank evidence is retained separately." (at 391.16 299.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d8d595cc-d24a-5df4-832b-b54d4e20f926"))
)
